At the first portability-control attempt, the shared working-tree compatibility test had already been changed by the parent to read tests/vnext/fixtures/c04_year_only_base84.json. Redirecting its ROOT to the isolated Git directory therefore raised FileNotFoundError for that fixture. This was a review-harness/live-tree mismatch, not a public adapter failure. The corrected control loads the specified4e8 test directly from Git and preserves its fixed-SHA scope. The parent compatibility fix is not reviewed by this task.
